{"id":"c63d0a313f501373","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-graph-cycle.md","title":"ZFC Graph Cycle","display":"df-zfc-graph-cycle — ZFC Graph Cycle","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-cycle","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-cycle"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-cycle — ZFC Graph Cycle","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-cycle"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-cycle</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-cycle — ZFC Graph Cycle"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\">\\(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\)</span> (simple undirected graph, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> (cycle length)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:n\\to V\">\\(c:n\\to V\\)</span> (cyclic vertex enumeration)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (simple-graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Injection}_S\\)</span> (injection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" href=\"?note=f5a60b2c6e668b3e\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-injection.md\">../batch11/58-df-injection.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cycle}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cycle}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}cycle} \\vdash \\operatorname{Cycle}(c,G,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,E\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land 3\\leq n\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(c,n,V)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\{c(i),c((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}cycle} \\vdash \\operatorname{Cycle}(c,G,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,E\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land 3\\leq n\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(c,n,V)\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\;\\{c(i),c((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The lower bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3\\leq n\">\\(3\\leq n\\)</span> excludes loops and two-edge degeneracies in a simple graph.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=\\langle V,E\\rangle$ (simple undirected graph, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (simple-graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-injection.md","status":"resolved","id":"f5a60b2c6e668b3e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Injection}_S$ (injection predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-injection.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G=\\langle V,E\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c:n\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Graph}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injection}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cycle}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}cycle} \\vdash \\operatorname{Cycle}(c,G,n)\\leftrightarrow\\exists V,E\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle V,E\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land n\\in\\omega\\land 3\\leq n\\land\\mathrm{Injection}_S(c,n,V)\\land\\forall i<n\\;\\{c(i),c((i+1)\\bmod n)\\}\\in E\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"3\\leq n","display":false}],"bytes":1095,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d06575772003f84","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Cycle}$ (cycle predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-graph-cycle]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2238","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exc